@title EMC-21: shielded motor cable of stated length shows capacitance and leakage current
@area Check
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The motor wire of the drive sits in an 80 m shielded cable (all round at both ends, no maker pF/m): EMC-21 works the capacitance out from the coaxial formula and says so.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-motor-cable.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "EMC check"
expect "EMC-21"
shot 01-findings
check_layout
scroll 360 400 -450
wait 10
expect "to earth"
expect "assumed"
shot 02-leakage-detail
check_layout
